  "rationale": "The selected conjunction proves leaveProgram typed, execution to leaveReturned with an already empty heap, and its final initial-frame exit. leave leaves its owned token parameter initialized; the return removes its frame, and with the caller t empty, collection reclaims the object immediately. consume body typing remains separately checked, not claimed to have a full execution in this example. Mandatory class consumption remains explicitly deferred. The machine/gc/steps units introduce the lifetime notation; inherited syntax, storage and typing notation remain in the listed dependency units. Functions keeps its explicit inherited-machinery forward reference to the appendix.",
